  first | exact @GlobalTheory.PtVanish.cmpForm_eq_zero_of_tanVal | exact GlobalTheory.PtVanish.cmpForm_eq_zero_of_tanVal | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.PtVanish.cmpForm_eq_zero_of_tanVal <;> assumption)
